Package: llikert
Title: Candidate-Token Probability Scoring Client
Version: 0.1.0.9000
Authors@R: person("The LLikert authors", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "louis@teitelbaum.us")
Description: Client for an LLikert scoring service. Defines scoring tasks with
    explicit response codes, prepares them against the service's language model,
    and scores text datasets to next-token probabilities for each response code,
    both as original probability mass and conditional on choosing one of the codes.
    Supports checkpointing and resume, and saves self-describing results. The client
    needs no Python or local inference runtime.
